# The Phrase page (the SEQ button's eighth page, after Feel): a chain of patterns by bar, a slice permutation of the drum steps, half or double time, and the
# condition of the lane chosen (the kick here: 1:2 plays it every other bar).
seed 0
wait 3000
turn SELECT 25 100
expect view 25
expect par164 0
spin K1 4
wait 100
expect par164 4
spin K2 3
wait 100
expect par165 3
spin K3 1
wait 100
expect par166 1
spin K4 1
wait 100
expect par167 1
shot phrase.png
# the chain plays patterns 1 1 3 4 by the bar: the pattern 3 comes on the third bar (about 6 s at 128), the kick's 1:2 and the others stay set
wait 8000
expect par164 4
spin K1 20
wait 100
expect par164 9
